                <head>114. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>NSC 114/3, “United States Programs for National Security,” June 5, 1952, included
                    Summary Statement No. 7—Foreign Intelligence and Related Activities, prepared by
                    the Central Intelligence Agency. For text of Summary Statement No. 7, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v02p1/pg_50"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1952–1954, volume II, Part 1, pages 50</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v02p1/pg_53">53</ref>.</p>
            </div>
